# Firebase config (FCM push notification credentials) - not secret in the
# strict sense (it's baked into every installed APK anyway) but keeping it
# out of git means the Android build stays broken-by-default in any fork
# instead of silently shipping to someone else's Firebase project.
android/app/google-services.json

